{"id": "16-1861-10-11", "zh": "tāṇaṃ（庇护）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1862-2-5", "zh": "rā、lā（这两个词根）表示“拿取”的意思。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1862-6-7", "zh": "rāti（拿取）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-1862-8-9", "zh": "lāti（拿取）。", "confidence": 85}
