{"id": "16-1863-8-9", "zh": "andati（系缚）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1863-10-11", "zh": "antaṃ（肠）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1863-12-13", "zh": "andu（脚镣）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-1864-2-6", "zh": "juta、subha、ruca（这几个词根）表示“发光”的意思。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-1864-7-8", "zh": "jotati（照耀）。", "confidence": 85}
